Assignment 1: My Task Manager

Description:
I made this application because I wanted to apply what I have learned, 
and establish order in school life.

Specifications:
My project uses the Java language, along with its built in Httpserver.
It also uses HTML for its front end. It is also uploaded for all to see on Github.

The features:
My application in its current state (1.0) can
Display and Add tasks to my to-do list, and run through a web browser of your choice.

How to display the task list:
Because this uses HTML, it may be confusing as the main result is not in the console
You need to run it, then copy the link of the local host into your main browser.

Upgrades I want to implement in the future:
Make tasks complete
delete and edit
due dates for tasks if needed